{
  "format": 1,
  "name": "flora_elevation_score",
  "spec": ["flora 6.1", "flora 6.2", "foundations 18"],
  "description": "Derived by hand from flora 6.1 and 6.2 with float32 arithmetic (foundations 18; checked with numpy float32). Test 3, scale 0.02f: d = 75 -> 1.5 -> 1; 310 -> 6.2 -> 6; 1000 -> 20 -> clamped 15; -30 -> 0; d = 50: 50 * 0.02f = 0.99999997765 rounds to 1.0f (the gap below 1 is 2^-24, the error 2.2e-8 is under half of it) -> 1; 100 -> 1.9999999553 -> 2.0f -> 2; 150 -> 2.999999933 -> 3.0f -> 3. A water type 120 m below sea: d = sea - altitude = 120 -> 2.4 -> 2. Scale 0.08 (code default): 70 -> 5.6 -> 5. Through the simulator (shipped scale 0.02, sea 250): ground 325 -> 1, ground 130 for a water type -> 2. Test 4: table byte 153 * f32(1/255) = 0.60000003548 -> f32 0.6 (0.60000002384); byte 25 (exemplar value 0.1) -> 0.0980392; an unknown type -> 0. [choice] A moisture type >= 16 reads byte 0 (score 0). The score uses the weather's moisture type (here 8, and 3 inside x 0..100) as the column.",
  "steps": [
    {"op": "flora_call", "method": "elevation_index", "args": [325, 250, false, 0.02], "expect": 1},
    {"op": "flora_call", "method": "elevation_index", "args": [560, 250, false, 0.02], "expect": 6},
    {"op": "flora_call", "method": "elevation_index", "args": [1250, 250, false, 0.02], "expect": 15},
    {"op": "flora_call", "method": "elevation_index", "args": [220, 250, false, 0.02], "expect": 0},
    {"op": "flora_call", "method": "elevation_index", "args": [300, 250, false, 0.02], "expect": 1},
    {"op": "flora_call", "method": "elevation_index", "args": [350, 250, false, 0.02], "expect": 2},
    {"op": "flora_call", "method": "elevation_index", "args": [400, 250, false, 0.02], "expect": 3},
    {"op": "flora_call", "method": "elevation_index", "args": [130, 250, true, 0.02], "expect": 2},
    {"op": "flora_call", "method": "elevation_index", "args": [130, 250, false, 0.02], "expect": 0},
    {"op": "flora_call", "method": "elevation_index", "args": [320, 250, false, 0.08], "expect": 5},

    {"op": "flora_types", "types": [
      {"type": "0x1000", "table_cells": [[1, 8, 0.6], [1, 3, 0.1], [2, 8, 0.1]]},
      {"type": "0x2000", "water": true, "table_cells": [[2, 8, 0.6]]}]},
    {"op": "flora_env", "ground": 325, "moisture": 8, "moistures": [[0, 0, 100, 1024, 3]]},
    {"op": "flora_create"},
    {"op": "flora_init", "expect": true},
    {"op": "flora_expect_record", "type": "0x1000", "table": [[1, 8, 153], [1, 3, 25], [2, 8, 25], [5, 5, 153], [0, 0, 0]]},
    {"op": "flora_call", "method": "elevation_index_at", "args": [500, 500, false], "expect": 1},
    {"op": "flora_call", "method": "score", "args": ["0x1000", 500, 500], "expect": 0.6},
    {"op": "flora_call", "method": "score", "args": ["0x1000", 50, 500], "expect": 0.0980392},
    {"op": "flora_call", "method": "score", "args": ["0x5555", 500, 500], "expect": 0},
    {"op": "flora_env", "ground": 130},
    {"op": "flora_call", "method": "elevation_index_at", "args": [500, 500, true], "expect": 2},
    {"op": "flora_call", "method": "score", "args": ["0x2000", 500, 500], "expect": 0.6},
    {"op": "flora_call", "method": "score", "args": ["0x1000", 500, 500], "expect": 0},
    {"op": "flora_env", "ground": 350},
    {"op": "flora_call", "method": "score", "args": ["0x1000", 500, 500], "expect": 0.0980392},
    {"op": "flora_env", "moisture": 16},
    {"op": "flora_call", "method": "score", "args": ["0x1000", 500, 500], "expect": 0}
  ]
}
